   "mechanism": "Schizophrenia-associated variation at the C4 locus increases effective C4 activity during circuit maturation, increasing complement marking and microglial elimination of synapses. C1QA supplies the classical-pathway initiation machinery and CX3CR1 regulates the pruning microglial state; the predicted outcome is reduced synapse density and dysconnected cortical circuits. The strongest historical claim favors C4A, but the returned locus-level SNP and copy-number records often implicate or map to both C4A and C4B, so paralogue specificity remains unresolved.",
